<!--
  YCDO — LETTER OF APPRECIATION
  Fixed English format matching the official paper letter. Not part of the
  shared Urdu letter shell — this is a standalone English document.
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 20mm 18mm 18mm 18mm; }

  body {
    font-family: "Times New Roman", "Liberation Serif", Times, Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 12.5pt;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .bismillah { text-align: center; font-size: 13pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; }

  .letterhead-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 6pt;
  }
  .letterhead-row img { max-height: 55px; }
  .letterhead-right { text-align: right; }
  .letterhead-org {
    text-align: right;
  }
  .letterhead-org .office { font-size: 10.5pt; }
  .letterhead-org .name { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .letterhead-org .loc { font-size: 10.5pt; }
  .letterhead-meta { margin-top: 6pt; text-align: right; font-size: 11pt; white-space: nowrap; }

  .title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 15pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 14pt 0 10pt;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 8pt;
  }

  .meta-block { margin: 10pt 0 14pt; }
  .meta-block .row { margin-bottom: 3pt; }
  .meta-block .label { font-weight: bold; }

  p { margin: 0 0 10pt; text-align: justify; }

  ol.reference-list { margin: 0 0 12pt; padding-inline-start: 22pt; }
  ol.reference-list li { margin-bottom: 6pt; text-align: justify; }

  .closing { margin-top: 14pt; }
  .signblock { margin-top: 28pt; }
  .signblock .name { font-weight: bold; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="bismillah">بِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ</div>

<div class="letterhead-row">
  {{#if letterheadLogoUrl}}<img src="{{letterheadLogoUrl}}" alt="">{{/if}}
  <div class="letterhead-right">
    <div class="letterhead-org">
      <div class="office">OFFICE OF THE</div>
      <div class="name">YOUTH COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT ORGANIZATION</div>
      <div class="loc">MULTAN, PAKISTAN</div>
    </div>
    <div class="letterhead-meta">
      <div>Letter no: {{letterRef}}</div>
      <div>Dated: {{issueDate}}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="title">LETTER OF APPRECIATION</div>

<div class="meta-block">
  <div class="row"><span class="label">From:</span> Chairman Admin Department</div>
  <div class="row">YCDO Multan, Pakistan</div>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:8pt;"><span class="label">To:</span> {{employeeName}}</div>
  <div class="row"><span class="label">Designation:</span> {{designation}}</div>
  <div class="row"><span class="label">Branch/Department:</span> {{branch}}</div>
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:8pt;"><span class="label">Subject:</span> Appreciation and Bonus Award</div>
</div>

<p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p>

<p>
  It gives us immense pleasure to place on record our sincere appreciation for
  your outstanding performance, dedication, and commitment towards your
  responsibilities at YCDO.
</p>

<p><strong>Reference:</strong></p>
<ol class="reference-list">
  <li>Performance Review Report No. {{reviewReportNo}} Dated: {{reviewReportDate}}</li>
  <li>Branch/Department Recommendation No. {{recommendationNo}} Dated: {{recommendationDate}}</li>
  <li>
    During the course of your duties, you have consistently demonstrated
    professionalism, devotion, and a strong sense of responsibility. Your
    valuable contributions have played a significant role in achieving
    organizational objectives and maintaining the standards of service
    expected by YCDO.
  </li>
  <li>
    In recognition of your exceptional performance, loyalty, and commitment
    towards the organization, the management is pleased to award you a
    <strong>Performance Bonus of Rs. {{bonusAmount}}</strong>. This bonus is
    being granted as a token of appreciation for your hard work, sincerity,
    and valuable contribution to the success of the organization.
  </li>
  <li>
    Your dedication and efforts are highly appreciated and serve as a
    positive example for your colleagues. The management acknowledges your
    contribution and looks forward to your continued commitment and
    excellence.
  </li>
  <li>
    We hope that you will continue to perform your duties with the same
    zeal, professionalism, and dedication in the future and remain an asset
    to YCDO.
  </li>
</ol>

<p>We extend our best wishes for your continued success and professional growth.</p>

<p class="closing">Sincerely,</p>

<div class="signblock">
  <div class="name">Chairman Admin Department</div>
  <div>YCDO Multan, Pakistan</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
